  "knownDifferences": [
    "CSV is accepted as a bounded nonspatial table unless a separately governed geometry and CRS mapping is supplied; this fixture does not infer spatial meaning from WKT-like text.",
    "PMTiles round-trip geometry is tile-quantized, is reported as MultiLineString, and is accepted only within 0.0013 geographic degrees rather than the exact vector tolerance.",
    "The exact MapServer 8.6.5 peer's GDAL 3.6 build rejects GeoParquet and PMTiles while the OpenGeo GDAL 3.13 worker executes both; support is not inferred from MapServer's general OGR flag.",
    "MapServer's exact peer executes FlatGeobuf, but FlatGeobuf is not yet an OpenGeo managed-upload input and is recorded as a compatibility-only case.",
    "COG retains its CRS and geographic extent; PNG and JPEG are intentionally handled as metadata-stripped project media rather than georeferenced raster datasets."
  ]
